bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    phase2_llvm_if_val_match_value_void_2026-11-16, 0, "Value-position if-val/else with a match whose arms return/break/continue previously let diverging/payloadless arms poison the join slot to void/Unit. Hardened mir_merge_arm_types, lower_if, lower_if_chain (mir_lowering_stmts.spl), and emit_switch_dispatch / emit_if_chain_dispatch / lower_match / lower_guarded_scalar_match / lower_enum_match_flat (switch_operators_calls.spl) to ignore Unit/Never arms when merging concrete value types while keeping all-diverging shapes (including closed guarded catch-all matches) sound. Unit spec if_val_match_diverging_value_type_spec.spl passes 9/9 in --mode=interpreter; native LLVM Phase 2 rebuild verification pending."

