    phase2_llvm_if_val_match_value_void_2026-11-16, 0, "2026-11-27 w3-1: hardened mir_merge_arm_types, lower_if, lower_if_chain (mir_lowering_stmts.spl) and switch/if-chain/match/guarded-match/enum-match merge paths (switch_operators_calls.spl) to ignore Unit/Never arms during branch unification and keep all-diverging exits sound. test/01_unit/compiler/50.mir/if_val_match_diverging_value_type_spec.spl passes 9/9 (--mode=interpreter); native Phase 2 LLVM rebuild verification pending."
